                                        "sense_id": "d07f6ea1-1a3d-3f19-b91a-3e1f418a95d6",
                                        "entry_id": "3c030c9e-4cab-3e1e-bca6-e0c53627d44d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An omnivorous, nocturnal mammal native to the Americas, of the genus Procyon, typically with a mixture of gray, brown, and black fur, a mask-like marking around the eyes and a striped tail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb541f8f-8cf8-384d-9555-5a2bd07ec4f7",
                                        "entry_id": "3c030c9e-4cab-3e1e-bca6-e0c53627d44d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The common raccoon (Procyon lotor)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9600bae6-3ec3-432b-8b5c-d30a557a19db",
                                                "sense_id": "bb541f8f-8cf8-384d-9555-5a2bd07ec4f7",
                                                "text": "Before a fire upon a seat like a bedsted, he sat covered with a great robe, made of Rarowcun skinnes, and all the tayles hanging by."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "863ccec3-bda5-4033-8974-3f8230e90b66",
                                                "sense_id": "bb541f8f-8cf8-384d-9555-5a2bd07ec4f7",
                                                "text": "The Rackoone is a deepe furred beaſt, not much unlike a Badger, having a tayle like a Fox, as good meate as a Lambe; there is one of them in the Tovver."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ec6e35c-0bc4-49f0-a6a8-3b8d6c33399e",
                                                "sense_id": "bb541f8f-8cf8-384d-9555-5a2bd07ec4f7",
                                                "text": "Thus we're presented with[…]a man who has the head of his penis bitten off by a raccoon, then bleeds to death in a forest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "319d0be5-6bba-3c09-b90d-0110835fed9e",
                                        "entry_id": "3c030c9e-4cab-3e1e-bca6-e0c53627d44d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any mammal of the subfamily Procyoninae, a procyonine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7d39ec4-a836-3491-9b07-59ec6ef3c953",
                                        "entry_id": "3c030c9e-4cab-3e1e-bca6-e0c53627d44d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any mammal of the family Procyonidae, a procyonid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
